{"code": 0, "msg": "成功", "data": {"id": 94147, "game_id": 1164, "entry_id": 66475, "uid": 82806, "type": 4, "title": "光人偶选择攻略（PVE）", "tag": "0", "created_at": 1639292404, "updated_at": 1639891963, "updated_uid": 0, "comment_at": 1639891963, "last_at": 1656579463, "comment_count": 0, "status": 1, "summary": "※标红的为增伤、加速、减防人偶，对伤害有比较明显提升※标紫色的为队长技增强人偶，这类人偶技能大部分都跟原有队长技不冲突※黑色为加盾、回血、吸血、追伤等人偶，对伤害提升不明显1.橙色艳后人偶，ns80%", "thumb": "", "model_ids": "", "like_count": 2, "unlike_count": 0, "view_count": 5258, "is_top": 0, "content_type": 0, "is_del": 0, "del_at": 0, "del_uid": 0, "is_release": 0, "source": 0, "last_ip_area": "", "is_prohibit_reply": 0, "is_only": 0, "state": 0, "audit_uid": 0, "favorite_count": 0, "seo": "", "video": "", "vote_ids": "", "is_elite": 0, "is_admin": 0, "audit_state": 0, "chat_game_id": 0, "is_image_text": 0, "from_chat": false, "chat_top": 0, "entry_auto": 1, "audit_at": 0, "server_id": 0, "image_num": 0, "video_list": "", "is_emulator": 0, "editor_type": 0, "ignore_hot": false, "mj_quote_num": 0, "mj_task_id": 0, "limit_age": 0, "important_at": 0, "is_expired": 0, "last_like_at": 0, "version": "", "word_count": 0, "content_id": 94147, "content": "<div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;background:rgb(255,255,255);\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;background:rgb(255,255,255);\"><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);\">※标红的为增伤、加速、减防人偶，对伤害有比较明显提升</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;background:rgb(255,255,255);\"><span style=\"color:rgb(177,56,206);\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;background:transparent;\">※</span>标紫色的为队长技增强人偶，这类人偶技能大部分都跟原有队长技不冲突</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;background:rgb(255,255,255);\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;background:transparent;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">※黑</span>色为加盾、回血、吸血、追伤等人偶，对伤害提升不明显</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;background:rgb(255,255,255);\"></div><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><section class=\"\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dcj/1638682604176_27525987.png\" alt=\"暗wb人偶选择攻略\" data-upload=\"true\" style=\"\"></section><div class=\"last-min-wrapper\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;min-height:1px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);\">1.橙色艳后人偶，ns80%概率给予自身10s集中，更偏向于rd的人偶，使rd可操竞速性更强（不BAN集中情况下），wb基本没用</span></div><div class=\"last-min-wrapper\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;min-height:1px;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639291374366_35536347.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639291374366_35536347.png\" style=\"width:165px;height:165px;\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\">2.橙色复活奶，NS解除2体石化，SS给予HP剩余最少2体150持续回血，偏RDRB向，给光双刃带增加队伍生存，WB可用</div></div><div class=\"last-min-wrapper\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;min-height:1px;\"><section class=\"\" style=\"\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dcj/1638682896908_93219892.png\" alt=\"暗wb人偶选择攻略\" data-upload=\"true\" style=\"\"></section></div><div class=\"last-min-wrapper\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;min-height:1px;\">3、紫色荷鲁斯，ns给予敌方8s内攻击力-15%，如果遇到对面是攻击力超高的boss，给光琴带增加我方生存</div><section class=\"\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dcj/1638683107658_39267334.png\" alt=\"暗wb人偶选择攻略\" data-upload=\"true\" style=\"\"></section><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(177,56,206);\">4、<span style=\"font-size:14px;\">紫色</span>女警人偶，队长技给予光属性队友技能伤害+7.5%，<span style=\"font-size:14px;\">RD时可以给你的RD队长，增加伤害，WB时</span><span style=\"font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);\">给光月月或者新对策，进一步增强队长技效果</span></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639291569986_55861472.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639291569986_55861472.png\" style=\"width:165px;height:165px;\"></div>5.紫色教皇，NS给予自身3秒减益无效，SS给予我方随机4体盾+1300，<span style=\"font-size:14px;\">偏RDRB向，给光双刃或者光兔子带增加队伍生存，WB可用</span></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639291699920_98381963.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639291699920_98381963.png\" style=\"width:165px;height:165px;\"></div>6.紫色埃及猫,NS给予暗属性敌方250追加伤害，SS给予敌方2体12秒失明，偏PVP向人偶，PVE给光刀增加FT伤害聊胜于无</span></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639291821648_43454742.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639291821648_43454742.png\" style=\"width:165px;height:165px;\"></div>7.紫色亚里亚，NS给予我方HP剩余最少1体盾+1300，SS给予自身DS条+7%，<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">偏RDRB向，给光相机或者主打N的逛天子增加队伍生存，同时加快进入FT，WB可用</span></span></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><section class=\"\" style=\"\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dcj/1638683649543_10918081.png\" alt=\"暗wb人偶选择攻略\" data-upload=\"true\" style=\"\"></section></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><section class=\"\" style=\"\">4、蓝色麻花人偶，ss给予暗属性敌方350追加伤害，追加伤害人偶都提升不大，但是没什么其他好的选择也可以给光狗，亚里亚不确定会不会跟自身的wb限定暗属性追加覆盖</section></div><section class=\"\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dcj/1638683800229_13731185.png\" alt=\"暗wb人偶选择攻略\" data-upload=\"true\" style=\"\"></section><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(177,56,206);\">5、束缚伊丝塔人偶，队长技减敌方5%debuff回避，偏WB向人偶，给光月月或者新对策，替换火妈队长，伤害提升不错，不适合RD</span></div><section class=\"\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dcj/1638684638619_67679309.png\" alt=\"暗wb人偶选择攻略\" data-upload=\"true\" style=\"\"></section><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">6、蓝色雷达人偶，ss给hp最少2名队员持续恢复量+17.5%，给复活奶增加ss奶量</div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><div class=\"last-min-wrapper\" style=\"min-height:1px;\"></div></div><div class=\"last-min-wrapper\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;min-height:1px;\"></div><section class=\"\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dcj/1638684906668_74508581.png\" alt=\"暗wb人偶选择攻略\" data-upload=\"true\" style=\"\"></section><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">7、绿色ns给hp剩余最少队友持续恢复量+15%，给光琴带，增加全队奶量</div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639292037571_67029087.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639292037571_67029087.png\" style=\"width:165px;height:165px;\"></div>8.绿色祭师，SS给予光属性我方1体16秒持续回复量+15%，给复活奶<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">增加ss奶量</span></div>", "content_json": "", "content_cdn": "", "is_favorite": 0, "is_like": 0, "is_unlike": 0, "thumb_list": null, "model_list": [], "user": {"uid": 82806, "username": "大花", "avatar": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/avatar/1/23.png", "description": "", "follow_num": 24, "custom_tag": {"tag_name": "", "tag_color": ""}, "role_id": 1, "is_super": false, "status": 1, "is_followed": 0, "subscribe_num": 1, "content_at": 114945282, "content_num": 85, "read_num": 465756, "like_num": 318}, "update_user": {"uid": 0, "username": "", "avatar": "", "description": "", "follow_num": 0, "custom_tag": {"tag_name": "", "tag_color": ""}, "role_id": 0, "is_super": false, "status": 0, "is_followed": 0, "subscribe_num": 0, "content_at": 0, "content_num": 0, "read_num": 0, "like_num": 0}, "game": {"id": 1164, "name": "天命之子日服", "i